{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝更新。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はNOGIBINGOの収録でしたよ。\nふほー楽しいなあ。\nめちゃ楽しいです。\nすごい自由な感じ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ショートにしたことあるのー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるよ！小5のとき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族で夏休みに沖縄旅行に行って\n真っ黒で男の子みたいだったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生ブログ見てる？\nみりりんやかりんちゃんのブログで\nまりっかの服装が話題に！笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見た！\n自分のこと書いてもらえるの嬉しいですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか照れますね！\nみり愛ちゃんかりんちゃん\nまた今度お洋服のお話しましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勉強するときって\n自分の部屋でしてます？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私リビングじゃないと\n集中できないのよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて握手会に行っても、\nコメントの名前を言ったらわかる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかると思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏のセールでお買い物したのかい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なに、セールやってるの？\nそれさえ知らないかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーでどんな曲\nやりたいとかあるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全曲やりたいよねー\nもうね、楽しみ過ぎる♪\nまだかなまだかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カラコンとか付けたりする？\n付けるとしたら何色？(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目に物を入れられない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こわい\nきれいな緑のカラコンしてみたい！\nゴスロリとか着て。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張したときどうやって治してる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち着いて深呼吸する。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洋服は自分で選ぶの？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ママと買い物行く時は\n一緒に選ぶ時もある！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな一方的な\nコメントしちゃってもいいのかなあ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかに迷惑じゃないかなあ。。\nってちょっと不安ですが笑。。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでー？コメントしてくれた方が\n嬉しいに決まってるよー\nいつもコメントありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「他の星から」に出てる\n紀の善のあんみつは食べましたか？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べたーい！\nそういえば、この曲の歌詞を改めて\n読んでみたんです。\nこういう世界観いいなーて思いました。\nこの女の子にしか\nわからないんだなーって。\nだから私もこれ聴きながら\n妄想するんです。\nどんな女の子なのかなーとか、\n想像するんです。\n楽しい、ふふ\n**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はいっぱい\n映画借りて見まくりです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10本借りました！うはぁお\n一週間で全部見なきゃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"土日に見たのは\nゴールデンスランバー\n桐島、部活やめるってよ\n時をかける少女\nおおかみこどもの雨と雪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジブリもだいすきだけど\n細田守さんの作品もだいすきですー\nサマーウォーズ特にすきで\nもう3回は見てるなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドラマも一話から忘れず見てるし、\n目がしっぱしっぱするよおお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏はなるべく外に出たくないね。\nすぐ肌が焼けるから"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恐ろしいですな。\n太陽恐ろしいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからって部屋にはこもりません。\n暑過ぎます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばいよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まじで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからね、\n家族みんなリビングで過ごしてます。\nすずいすずい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とまとかなぺちょすきすきー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もお仕事だー\nがんばるーーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/16/3599687/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}